    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mysherryfitz.ie \nThis immaculately maintained three-bedroom semi-detached home is conviently located off O'Brien Road in Carlow town, offering immediate access to main roads, schools, shops and all amentities.\nPresenting in its orginal configuration, accomodation extends over two floors with a traditional three-bedroom layout. An integrated garage cavity offers additional scope, while a small extended utility to the rear compliments the orginal kitchen.\nExternally, the fully walled site supports off-street parking to its front , with a secure side gated enterance to a large rear garden.\nViewings are highly recommended and invited on a strictly appointment basis"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHall - 4.13 x 2.40\nUPVC Hall Door with side glazing panels.Laminate wooden floor.Carpeted stairs with storage beneath.Alarm control panel.Phone point.\n\nSitting Room - 4.21x 3.66\nGlass pannelled door from hall.Windows to front, curtains, pole & blind.Laminated wooden floor.Solid fuel fireolace with electric fire insert.Open arch to dining room.\n\nDining Room - 3.77 x 3.66\nWindows to rear.Curtains pole & blind.Laminated wooden flooring.Glass panneled door to kitchen.\n\nKitchen - 3.58 x 2.71\nWindows to rear, blinds.Marley flooring.Fully fitted wall and floor units.Part tiled walls.Breakfast bar.Utility off.\n\nUtility Room - 2.86 x 2.39\nWindows to rear.Glass Panelled UPVC door to side.Marley flooring.Electric oven, gas hob.Part tiled walls.Plumbing.Door to garage.\n\nGarage - 5.50 x 2.46\nUp and over door to front.Concrete floor and walls.Wall mounted gas boiler\n\nLanding - 3.22 x 2.52\nWindows to side, blinds.Carpeted.Hot press Stira attic access to floored area.\n\nBathroom - 2.73 x 1.70\nWindows to rear.Marley flooring.Tiled walls.Toilet, sink, shower.\n\nBedrrom 1 - 3.79 x 3.81\nDouble room.Windows to rear.Curtains, pole & blind.Carpeted.\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.16 x 3.61\nDouble Room.Windows to front.Curtains, pole & blind.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.94 x 2.51\nSingle room.Windows to front.Curtains, pole & blind.Carpeted.Built in storage unit.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Block built house.</li><li>UPVC double glazing.</li><li>Gas fited central heating.</li><li>Off street parking.</li><li>Walled rear garden.</ul>"
